  "notes": [
    "All final required checks passed. Totals include repeated executions, not unique test counts. The two pre-existing ignored tests are unchanged.",
    "All 56 pinned source integration tests are retained across execution_probe, protocol_position, current_execution, current_observations and current_wallet. Generic evidence pairing and built-binary isolation, determinism, output protection and route selection add four tests.",
    "Current path checks use shared account pairing, standard token decoding/balance evidence, loader headers, Clock and byte-range measurements. Historical validator-boundary evidence is never fabricated; adapter count remains five.",
    "Initial compile attempts exposed the package/crate name, relocated namespaces and an unnecessary removal of the runtime Clock clone. The corrected type retains its clone; clippy passes without suppressions.",
    "Initial reference tests exposed a wallet slot still encoded as a number and one CLI fixture absent from the T6 closure. The original asset/position/report dependencies were independently pinned and imported. Compute assertions now parse MAIN decimal strings without changing quantities.",
    "The full regression run detected that encoding the decoded position timestamp as a string also changes counterfactual/assurance digest links. A diagnostic confirmed the exact pre-execution position comparison. The original T6 projection is unchanged; a separate 92-file projection converts this one additional field and updates all dependent hashes. Fifteen derived files differ from T6. Generators do not run the engine or derive expected economic findings.",
    "Every original capture/program byte remains exact. Added fixture payloads are ignored; only scripts, provenance and projection records are committed. Missing artifacts fail tests.",
    "Parent capture alone can read the provider environment. Offline workers use env_clear, reject inherited variables and refuse capture requests. Live-provider checks remain intentionally not run. No live signing, cluster simulation/submission, deployment or push occurred.",
    "Current capture acceptance uses mock/reconstructed providers and frozen deployed bytes. It does not qualify a live provider, prove a validator bank, authenticate an owner, or authorize a transaction.",
    "Dashboard/browser and Postgres hosted suites remain pending T8/T9. Existing MAIN frontend/report/governance checks pass with pnpm 11.24.0. The T8 presentation glossary remains separate from immutable machine codes.",
    "Logs are scratch records; digests do not promise durable log storage."
  ]
